# Trivy vulnerability suppressions — audited, build-tool-only advisories.
#
# Scope of the runtime image (Dockerfile `runtime` stage) is the Spring Boot
# fat JAR on productionRuntimeClasspath. The two entries below are pulled ONLY
# by the Checkstyle static-analysis tool (the `checkstyle` Gradle configuration)
# which runs in CI and is NEVER packaged into the published container image or
# executed at runtime. They are therefore not exploitable in the delivered
# artifact. They remain visible to `trivy fs` because it scans the full Gradle
# lockfile, so they are suppressed by CVE id here with justification. New CVEs on
# these packages are NOT suppressed and will re-open the gate for review.
#
# Re-audit trigger: bump the `checkstyle` toolVersion in build.gradle.kts so the
# patched transitives (httpcore5 >= 5.4.3, plexus-utils >= 3.6.1) are pulled,
# then delete the matching line below.

# org.apache.httpcomponents.core5:httpcore5 5.3.6 — Checkstyle transitive only.
CVE-2026-54399

# org.codehaus.plexus:plexus-utils 3.3.0 — Checkstyle transitive only.
CVE-2025-67030
